  "prefLabel": "Ac 401.03 Certificate, Registration, and Permit Expiration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ac 401.03 Certificate, Registration, and Permit Expiration.\n\n(a) Each CPA certificate shall expire 2 years from the day the license was issued. No person shall hold themselves out as a CPA to the public in New Hampshire without a valid New Hampshire certificate.\n\n(b) Each PA registration shall expire 2 years from the day the license was issued. No person shall hold themselves out as a PA to the public in New Hampshire, without a valid New Hampshire registration.\n\n(c) Each firm permit shall expire 2 years from the day the license was issued. No firm shall hold itself out as an accounting firm to the public in New Hampshire without a valid New Hampshire permit.\n\nSource. #6904, eff 12-4-98, EXPIRED: 12-4-06\n\nNew. #8810, INTERIM, eff 1-25-07, EXPIRED: 7-25-07\n\nNew. #9051, eff 12-27-07; ss by #10746, eff 1-1-15; ss by #14322, eff 9-15-25, EXPIRES: 9-15-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ac100-500.html"
